WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Twelve fictional files. Select the files and request a local Gemma plan.

00:06.000 --> 00:14.000
The 89.6-second model wait is shortened here. Review now plays at half speed.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.500
Nine proposed moves, one file kept here and two files held for review.

00:20.500 --> 00:28.500
Approve nine moves. Move history records their destinations.

00:28.500 --> 00:36.000
Undo the recorded moves and return the unchanged files to the inbox.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.550
All twelve files are back. A separate filesystem check confirmed the original hashes.
